# Direct Python dependencies. PyICU is deliberately absent: it ships no wheel,
# so pip would compile a C++ extension — under QEMU on the arm64 publish leg.
# Debian's prebuilt python3-icu is used instead, reached via a
# --system-site-packages venv, which is what the pre-refactor image did.
# Direct Python dependencies. requirements.txt is generated from this file with
# fully pinned versions and hashes; regenerate with `make requirements`.
